<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Curacao Crisis French Interention, 2021</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt" align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Curacao Crisis UK and French Intervention, 2021&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt" align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Al "Beirutdude" Sandrik&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt" align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;The Time Is: 18 November 1983,10:00 Zulu/6:00 Atlantic Time&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt" align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Created: 11 November 2020 C:MO V1.02 Build 1174.14&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt" align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Caribbean Sea&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt" align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Playable as Organization of American States (OAS)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt" align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Uo To 2 Days in Duration &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt" align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;(Note this scenario has a 24-36 hour strategic phase, you don't jump in shooting) &lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt" align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Thanks to AndrewJ, Blast33, tylerblakeberandon, Sechu, Magi, schweggy and Gunner98 for their advice and play testing&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt" align=left&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12px; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(225,225,225); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;IMPORTANT: &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;Please do not delete the RPs around Curacao. You need those for gaining VPs. If you create a Cargo Operation (I'd suggest taking personal control of the landings) you should use those RPs for its creation.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;Background: The tension between the United States and Venezuela over the past few years has dominated the headlines but tensions with the Netherlands/Netherlands Antilles had also risen with the ongoing humanitarian crisis. One aspect of the Venezuelan relationship with Curacao, which many don’t realize, is the sprawling "Isla Refinery" along Willemstad Harbor is a major refiner for Petróleos de Venezuela, S.A. (PDVSA). Until 2019 PDVSA had the contract to run the refinery with over 57% of the product being produced for the company and the refinery is mostly run by Venezuelan nationals. In 2020 that changed when a company from the PRC bid on the contract promising to put 5.5B USD in upgrades into the aging facility. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;This on its own was increasing tension in the region, but in March of 2019 the United States and the Netherlands reached an agreement to use Curacao as a staging area for humanitarian relief to Venezuela. Despite strict limitations that the relief must be requested and peaceful, the Mudero government protested and warned the Netherlands to stay out of Venezuelan affairs.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;In November of 2021 things spiraled out of control with renewed anti-government protests and the transfer of the refinery from Venezuelan control. Venezuelan opposition leader Juan Guaido continued pressing for humanitarian aid to be allowed in with food riots in Puerto Cumarebo and other port cities. In early November American aircraft began to land supplies in Curacao for use by Non-Government Organizations (NGOs). &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;Mudero had had enough. In the early morning hours of 16 November Venezuelan "Volunteers" swarmed out of the refinery while troops of the 12th Caribbean Ranger Brigade landed on the island. Unlike the Falkland’s in 1982, the attack wasn’t bloodless. The Royal Netherland Navy’s HNLMS Pelikaan (A804) was sunk trying to escape Willemstad Harbor with the loss of seven crew and the wounding of four. The Dutch Naval Staff and Governor General on the island fled to the French consulate where they were surrounded and besieged. Venezuelan declared a 30 nm "Exclusion Zone" around the island and warned any ship or plane entering that zone will be fired upon and destroyed.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;The United States, and new Biden Administration, deferred getting involved in another “Colonial War.” The UK, France and the Netherlands, on the other hand, began to press their case before both the U.N. and the Organization of American States (OAS). U.N. Resolution S/RES/2559 (2021) called for Venezuela to immediately withdraw from the island. In the OAS the results were more mixed. Cuba, Haiti, The Dominican Republic and Columbia all declared neutrality and refused overflights. Jamaica offered the use of facilities on the island and some police forces, The Bahamas a patrol craft (not modeled but nice of them!) and police forces, and other nations expressed support. Over the next few days Venezuela flies/ferries tourists and foreigners to the mainland where they are allowed to make arrangements to travel to home. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;More substantially, Mudero couldn’t have chosen a worse time to act. The French LPD Dixmude (L9015) is scheduled to meet the HNLMS Rotterdam (L800) and HNLMS Evertsen (F805) at Phillipsburg Harbor, Sint Maarten for joint amphibious exercises on Saba on the 21&lt;SUP&gt;st&lt;/SUP&gt;. The French Carrier Charles De Gaulle (R91) is also in the eastern Caribbean to support the Saba exercise along with some French Air Force assets on Guadeloupe. The Queen Elizabeth CVBG is off Mayport, Florida conducting Carrier Qualification (CQ) exercises with the USMC and after debarking the Marines hurried south to support the&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt; &lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Calibri",sans-serif; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA'&gt;Netherlands and is positioned near the Mona Passage.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;The 32nd Raiding Squadron (Dutch Caribbean Forces) consisting of 153 personnel and special boats, is stationed in Aruba (and is responsible for the defense of the Netherlands Antilles but was caught off guard). Between Russian support, the media and people Tweeting about aircraft taking off, surprise is all but impossible and the Venezuelans will be ready for you!&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;Notes: Your mission is to liberate the island with minimal losses and without undue damage to the Isla refinery and other civilian infrastructure. You have plenty of time to reposition forces and load out your aircraft, this is not a scenario where you just jump right into the action, you need to plan your strategy. You obtain victory by placing forces on Curacao/destroying Venezuelan units and loose points by seeing civilian infrastructure destroyed and loosing friendly/third party units.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;There is a teleport that takes place one (1) second into the scenario for randomness. Please run the scenario for about fifteen (15) seconds before setting up missions to allow the computer (A/I) missions to start. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;I marked the Venezuelan Exclusion Zone with locked RPs, which you can delete at your discretion but again be careful not to delete the RP on Curacao itself!&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;An INI and a Delta file have both been included for deep rebuilds.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=silver&gt;Al "BeirutDude" Sandrik (ex-Beachinnole)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT color=blue face=Calibri&gt;Al.Sandrik@gmail.com&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P align=center&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
